+## Android body composition
+
+**New in recent releases:** read and write `leanBodyMass`, `boneMass`, and `bodyWaterMass` on **Android** via Health Connect (kilograms). Pair them with `bodyFat` and `weight` for smart-scale style dashboards. These three types are **not supported on iOS** yet; `saveSample` and `readSamples` reject them with an unsupported type error on Apple platforms.
